# Referral short links. The site is a static assets-only Worker, so `/r/<code>`
# cannot be rendered per-code — it redirects to the invite page instead, which
# reads `?code=` on the client. Keep one line per locale so a localized invite
# link lands on the localized page.
/r/*     /invite?code=:splat     302
/ar/r/*  /ar/invite?code=:splat  302
/de/r/*  /de/invite?code=:splat  302
